  "observations": [
    "Coefficients a0..a4 are r8 (double); four histories x1/x2/y1/y2 are r4 (float32).",
    "SetLowPassFilter computes sin/cos coefficients and calls SetCoefficients.",
    "SetCoefficients normalizes b0,b1,b2,a1,a2 by a0, then clears four histories.",
    "UpdateLowPassFilter writes the normalized coefficients directly, preserving histories.",
    "Scalar Transform promotes sample and history to double, sums products sequentially, rounds final output to float32, advances histories."
  ],
